      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "page-looks-graph"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='--paper:#ffffff;--ink:#1f2937;--muted:#6b7280;--accent:#0f766e;--line:#e5e7eb;--body:color-mix(in srgb,#1f2937 88%,#ffffff);--tint:color-mix(in srgb,#0f766e 7%,#ffffff);--tint-strong:color-mix(in srgb,#0f766e 14%,#ffffff);--tint-line:color-mix(in srgb,#0f766e 28%,#ffffff);--soft:color-mix(in srgb,#e5e7eb 60%,#ffffff);--code-bg:color-mix(in srgb,#1f2937 6%,#ffffff);--serif:Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;--body-font:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;--sans:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;--mono:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;width:100%;min-height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--body-font);padding:clamp(20px,4cqw,48px)'><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:36px clamp(28px,5cqw,64px);max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto'><aside data-role='contents' style='flex:1 1 210px;min-width:0;align-self:flex-start'><div style='font:800 clamp(10px,1.5cqw,13px)/1.3 var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--accent)'>OPERATING HANDBOOK</div><h1 style='margin:10px 0 0;font:700 clamp(26px,4.4cqw,40px)/1.05 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.015em;color:var(--ink)'>How we run the studio</h1><p style='margin:10px 0 0;font:400 14px/1.5 var(--sans);color:var(--muted)'>Five short chapters. Read them in order once, then use the list on the left.</p><ol style='margin:22px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><li style='display:flex;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:600 14px/1.3 var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'><span style='color:var(--accent);min-width:1.6em'>01</span>Overview</li><li style='display:flex;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:600 14px/1.3 var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'><span style='color:var(--accent);min-width:1.6em'>02</span>Setup</li><li style='display:flex;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:600 14px/1.3 var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'><span style='color:var(--accent);min-width:1.6em'>03</span>Daily use</li><li style='display:flex;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:600 14px/1.3 var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'><span style='color:var(--accent);min-width:1.6em'>04</span>Reviews</li><li style='display:flex;gap:10px;padding:9px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font:600 14px/1.3 var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'><span style='color:var(--accent);min-width:1.6em'>05</span>When it goes wrong</li></ol><div style='margin-top:26px'><section data-role='settings' style='padding-top:10px;border-top:3px solid var(--ink)'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink)'>About this handbook</h2><dl style='margin:0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;column-gap:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)'><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font:400 13px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--muted)'>Owner</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere'>Studio lead</dd><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font:400 13px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--muted)'>Version</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere'>3.2</dd><dt style='padding:9px 0 9px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font:400 13px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--muted)'>Reviewed</dt><dd style='margin:0;padding:9px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right;font:600 14px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--ink);overflow-wrap:anywhere'>Every quarter</dd></dl></section></div></aside><main style='flex:3 1 380px;min-width:0'><section data-role='section' style='padding:0 0 0;'><div style='font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent)'>01</div><h2 style='margin:8px 0 14px;font:700 clamp(22px,3.2cqw,30px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)'>Overview</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>The studio is small on purpose. This handbook says who decides what, where work lives, and how it gets reviewed.</p><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>Nothing here is a rule for its own sake: each chapter ends with the reason.</p></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:34px 0 0;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><div style='font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent)'>02 · WEEK ONE</div><h2 style='margin:8px 0 14px;font:700 clamp(22px,3.2cqw,30px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)'>Setup</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>Everyone needs the same three things:</p><ul style='margin:0 0 14px;padding-left:22px;max-width:60ch;font:400 18px/1.55 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'><li style='margin:0 0 6px'>an account on the shared drive</li><li style='margin:0 0 6px'>the weekly calendar</li><li style='margin:0 0 6px'>a pairing partner for the first month</li></ul></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:34px 0 0;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><div style='font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent)'>03</div><h2 style='margin:8px 0 14px;font:700 clamp(22px,3.2cqw,30px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)'>Daily use</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>Work starts from the board, never from a message. If something is not on the board, it is not work yet.</p><h3 style='margin:22px 0 8px;font:700 15px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--ink)'>Stand-ups</h3><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>Fifteen minutes, standing, at ten.</p></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:34px 0 0;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><div style='font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent)'>04 · EVERY FRIDAY</div><h2 style='margin:8px 0 14px;font:700 clamp(22px,3.2cqw,30px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)'>Reviews</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>A review looks at what changed, not who changed it. The reviewer writes one sentence of praise and at most three notes.</p></section><section data-role='section' style='padding:34px 0 0;margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><div style='font:800 12px/16px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--accent)'>05</div><h2 style='margin:8px 0 14px;font:700 clamp(22px,3.2cqw,30px)/1.15 var(--serif);letter-spacing:-.01em;color:var(--ink)'>When it goes wrong</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 var(--body-font);color:var(--body)'>Say so early, in the open channel, with what you know and what you do not. Fixing it comes before finding out why.</p></section><div style='margin-top:40px'><nav data-role='routes' style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 28px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)'><span style='font:800 11px/20px var(--sans);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)'>Next</span><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/primitives/root/root.node' style='font:700 14px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>Report a problem →</a><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/primitives/property/root.node' style='font:700 14px/20px var(--sans);color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none'>Suggest a change →</a></nav></div></main></div></div>"
        },
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          }
        }
      }
    },
